keywords:
  - forecast evaluation
  - forecast comparison
  - target support
  - benchmark design
  - representativeness error
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen derived tables, figure source data and manifests for controlled
  tests of verifying-target support in comparative weather-model evaluation.
  Includes the forecast-smoothing and observational support-ladder
  interventions, the multi-support ranking uncertainty analysis, the global
  physical-heterogeneity association analysis, the negative cross-family
  roughness test and the self-contained domain-free support-ranking control.
